implementationPlan.description:
VERIFY GREEN. Run everything sequentially on a quiet box, because parallel harness runs flake. Use MOE_POSTFLIGHT_TIMEOUT_SEC=400. Launch the ps1 harness from PowerShell.

1. Run each of the 3 new arms alone:
   - sh from Git Bash;
   - postflight.ps1 on pwsh 7;
   - postflight.ps1 on PS 5.1 (powershell -NoProfile -File scripts/tests/postflight.ps1).
2. On sh and on pwsh, run the 7 existing receipt arms plus teardown-landed and loop-land-twice through MOE_FROZEN_TEST_ONLY.
3. Run the full 'bash scripts/tests/postflight.sh' (about 40-50 min), and the full postflight.ps1 on pwsh 7 and on PS 5.1. Report the PASS lines: the frozen scenario count must be the pre-change count + 3.
4. Run 'bash scripts/tests/parity-check.sh', 'pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/tests/parity-check.ps1' and 'powershell -NoProfile -File scripts/tests/parity-check.ps1'.
5. Acceptance criterion 6, UNEDITED: 'git diff --stat packages/moe-daemon/src/delivery/acceptance.test.ts' must be empty, then run 'cd packages/moe-daemon && npx vitest run src/delivery/acceptance.test.ts'.
6. MUTATION PROOFS, each reverted afterwards. Run the sh arm against moe-agent.sh and the ps1 arm against moe-agent.ps1:
   (a) skip the ledger re-send: receipt-ledger-replay fails;
   (b) skip the rewritten-copy search: receipt-rebase-replay fails;
   (c) restore the own-seat-only finalize guard: receipt-foreign-replay fails;
   (d) never drop 'ledger' in the post-record rewrite: receipt-refused fails.

For complete_task, the verification is the full postflight.sh command, and outputTail is the PASS lines.
